's  also earned positive reviews from  critics  is this something people have been  talking about with a wacky sense of  humor trial and error often gets much  more bizarre than its premise would  suggest making each episode a hilarious  comedic surprise izombie comic-book  properties may be all the rage but most  viewers are sleeping on one of the best  comic book adaptations on TV The CW's  iZombie is a smart funny and  quick-witted adaptation of the vertigo  series of the same name in the iZombie  universe eating someone's brains gives  you a hint about how they passed away  and Medical Examiner live who happens to  be a zombie uses her skill to assist the  Seattle Police Department in solving  their most difficult cases by zombies  procedural elements are consistent  delights of what has made the series  truly great as the expansion of its  world balancing week-to-week storylines  with season-long storylines the show  posed compelling characters and fun  romance thanks for watching click the  loop icon to subscribe to our youtube  channel plus check out all this cool  stuff we know you're loved today  [Music]
 

